data: {"id": "a18143b265a34df9-thinking-parallel_evidence-1104", "run_id": "a18143b265a34df9", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n### 已确认事实\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：`aiops-case-v16/workload` 处于 `Running` 状态，但 `READY=0/1`，即 NotReady。\n2. **NotReady 直接原因**：Readiness Probe 持续失败，已有 **960 次** `connection refused` 事件（持续 77 分钟，每 5 秒探测一次）：\n   ```\n   Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.33:18081/ready\": dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused\n   ```\n3. **Probe 配置**（来自 YAML）：\n   - `readinessProbe`: `http-get http://:18081/ready`，`delay=5s`，`timeout=1s`，`period=5s`\n4. **容器实际监听端口**（来自 YAML 的 command 和日志）：\n ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789391049790, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

